</li><li>LED Indicator Testing – Displays open circuits, shorts, cross-wiring, split pairs, and continuity status.</li><li>High Testing Accuracy – Ensures reliable diagnostics for network installation and maintenance.</li><li>Remote Test Capability – Includes a detachable remote unit for long-distance cable testing.</li><li>Portable &amp; Lightweight Design – Easy to carry and ideal for field technicians.</li><li>Durable Construction – Built to withstand regular professional use.</li><li>Wide Application – Suitable for LAN networks, CCTV systems, telephone lines, and data communication projects.</li><li>User-Friendly Operation – Simple interface designed for both beginners and professionals.</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/trendnet-tc-nt2-network-cable-tester\">TRENDnet TC-NT2 Network Cable Tester</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span clas